# supercronic crontab for the depas-cron sidecar (TZ=America/Santiago).
#
# Hourly pass: scrape the communes in DEPAS_COMMUNES, then enrich whatever
# is new. Runs at :07 rather than :00 so the portal isn't hit by a clock-aligned
# request every hour.
7 * * * * depas watch

# Watchdog: warn the admins by DM when no pass has completed in four hours. The
# hourly one is what posts the alerts, so a crash loop there is otherwise silent.
0 */4 * * * depas healthcheck
